{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/reviews/id1026065410"}, "name":{"label":".1274637383"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-19T03:15:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.28.0"}, "id":{"label":"14446234717"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, but premium pricing is tough for young couples"}, "content":{"label":"I really enjoy using Couple Joy. it’s a thoughtful and well-designed app that helps couples stay connected and deepen their relationship. The daily prompts, shared journal, and widgets are fantastic features that make a real difference.\nHowever, my main concern is the pricing of the Premium subscription. Many useful features are locked behind the paywall, and while the cost is listed as €7.50 per user, in practice only one person usually pays, which ends up being €15 per month. For younger couples (around 15–20 years old) who are still in school and don’t have their own income, this is a significant amount to pay every month especially if parents aren’t covering it.\nI’d love to see more affordable options, such as a reduced student rate or a lower-cost tier, so that more young couples can benefit from the full experience without financial stress. Overall, a wonderful app with room for more accessible pricing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/de/review?id=1624758651&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Programm"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
